WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.443 --> 00:00:03.766
HE IS SAYING THAT HE IS FEELING

00:00:03.767 --> 00:00:04.064
FINE.

00:00:04.065 --> 00:00:05.716
KATIE, ALL OF THIS COMES AT A

00:00:05.717 --> 00:00:07.556
TIME WHEN THE NATION’S NUMBERS

00:00:07.557 --> 00:00:09.604
ARE SO HUGE.

00:00:09.605 --> 00:00:11.409
YOU MENTIONED THE NEARLY 1900

00:00:11.410 --> 00:00:13.031
TOTAL FOR JUST YESTERDAY OF

00:00:13.032 --> 00:00:14.451
PEOPLE WHO PASSED AWAY.

00:00:14.452 --> 00:00:15.708
THESE ARE PEOPLE THAT WE ARE

00:00:15.743 --> 00:00:16.132
LOSING.

00:00:16.133 --> 00:00:19.826
THIS FEELS LIKE IT DID ALMOST IN

00:00:19.860 --> 00:00:20.670
THE BEGINNING.

00:00:20.671 --> 00:00:23.137
IT FEELS LIKE WHAT THEY TOLD US

00:00:23.138 --> 00:00:24.243
TO EXPECT.

00:00:24.244 --> 00:00:25.861
YOU SEE GOVERNORS TALKING ABOUT

00:00:25.895 --> 00:00:26.536
MASKS.

00:00:26.570 --> 00:00:30.425
HERE IN NEW JERSEY THEY ARE.

00:00:30.426 --> 00:00:32.636
THIS IS A SEPARATE CONVERSATION

00:00:32.670 --> 00:00:34.591
TO PEOPLE THAN POLITICS.

00:00:34.626 --> 00:00:35.849
YOU KNOW POLITICS INVADES

00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:36.276
EVERYTHING.

00:00:36.277 --> 00:00:38.408
&gt;&gt; YES.

00:00:38.409 --> 00:00:41.364
THE VIRUS INVADES EVERYTHING.

00:00:41.366 --> 00:00:43.555
EMILY, GOVERNMENT OFFICIALS ARE

00:00:43.589 --> 00:00:45.658
TRYING TO MAKE THESE DECISIONS

00:00:45.693 --> 00:00:47.211
ABOUT LOCKDOWNS.

00:00:47.213 --> 00:00:52.219
WE KNOW NOW A LOT MORE ABOUT THE
CONSEQUENCES OF LOCKDOWNS.

00:00:52.220 --> 00:00:53.733
CONSEQUENCES OF LOCKDOWNS.

00:00:53.767 --> 00:00:59.923
MISSED MEDICAL APPOINTMENTS AND

00:00:59.924 --> 00:01:04.117
SUICIDE ARE UP, VETERAN SUICIDES

00:01:04.151 --> 00:01:06.748
ARE UP WITH ISOLATION OF THIS

00:01:06.782 --> 00:01:07.311
DISEASE.

00:01:07.346 --> 00:01:10.646
WHERE ARE WE GOING BACK TO

00:01:10.647 --> 00:01:11.802
LOCKDOWNS BALANCING THE

00:01:11.803 --> 00:01:13.853
CONSEQUENCES OF KEEPING PEOPLE

00:01:13.888 --> 00:01:14.552
FROM WORKING?

00:01:14.553 --> 00:01:16.381
&gt;&gt; THAT’S RIGHT.

00:01:16.416 --> 00:01:18.410
THAT’S WHY THIS IS SO HEART

00:01:18.444 --> 00:01:19.092
BREAKING.

00:01:19.093 --> 00:01:22.687
THERE IS A FAILURE IN MY OPINION

00:01:22.688 --> 00:01:25.277
TO CAPTURE AND WEIGH IN AN EQUAL

00:01:25.278 --> 00:01:28.186
MANNER ALL OF THE OTHER EFFECTS

00:01:28.221 --> 00:01:29.972
HAPPENING THAT ARE HEART

00:01:29.973 --> 00:01:30.427
BREAKING.

00:01:30.461 --> 00:01:32.727
THE NOTION OF A SECOND ECONOMIC

00:01:32.728 --> 00:01:33.848
LOCKDOWN IS FRANKLY TERRIFYING

00:01:33.882 --> 00:01:34.633
TO ME.

00:01:34.635 --> 00:01:36.278
JUST TO FOCUS ON ECONOMICS FOR

00:01:36.312 --> 00:01:37.572
A QUICK MOMENT.

00:01:37.606 --> 00:01:40.709
OVER 90% OF BUSINESSES IN THIS

00:01:40.710 --> 00:01:42.158
COUNTRY ARE SMALL AND MEDIA

00:01:42.159 --> 00:01:43.243
SIZED.

00:01:43.245 --> 00:01:44.569
OVER 100,000 SHUTTERED

00:01:44.570 --> 00:01:46.718
PERMANENTLY BECAUSE OF THE FIRST

00:01:46.720 --> 00:01:48.261
COVID-19 LOCKDOWN AND 1 IN 5

00:01:48.263 --> 00:01:49.536
BUSINESS OWNERS ESTIMATE THEY

00:01:49.538 --> 00:01:51.082
WON’T MAKE IT TO THE END OF THE

00:01:51.083 --> 00:01:51.759
YEAR.

00:01:51.760 --> 00:01:53.289
THAT’S WITHOUT A SECOND

00:01:53.290 --> 00:01:54.177
LOCKDOWN.

00:01:54.178 --> 00:01:57.544
WE SPOKE IN THE LAST BLOCK ABOUT

00:01:57.546 --> 00:01:58.157
AFRICAN-AMERICANS.

00:01:58.158 --> 00:02:00.265
THEY ARE AFFECTED AS ACTIVE

00:02:00.299 --> 00:02:03.061
BLACK OWNED SMALL BUSINESSES

00:02:03.096 --> 00:02:05.891
WERE DOWN 41% IN THE FIRST

00:02:05.926 --> 00:02:06.378
LOCKDOWN.

00:02:06.412 --> 00:02:09.616
THESE ARE REAL STATISTICS THAT

00:02:09.617 --> 00:02:10.960
HAVE CONSEQUENCES FOR PEOPLE’S

00:02:10.961 --> 00:02:12.660
LIVELIHOODS AND PUTTING FOOD ON

00:02:12.661 --> 00:02:14.751
THE TABLE.

00:02:14.786 --> 00:02:18.767
I SPEAK FOR MY OWN FAMILY.

00:02:18.801 --> 00:02:21.447
WE LIVED PAYROLL TO PAYROLL WITH

00:02:21.449 --> 00:02:23.665
OUR SMALL BUSINESSES.

00:02:23.666 --> 00:02:25.213
THE OTHER ONES DIDN’T SURVIVE

